 is properly absent, because only one location is in view. So this is specifically about the "},{"type":"text","text":"chooser","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":", not the column."}]},{"type":"rule"},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"6 · Images"}]},{"type":"mediaSingle","attrs":{"layout":"center"},"content":[{"type":"media","attrs":{"type":"file","id":"774cf1c3-eda1-4781-a7b3-e00137942b08","collection":"","height":183,"width":900}}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"sales-by-customer-single-location-chooser.png","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Sales By Customer, signed in as Wesley McClure at "},{"type":"text","text":"Staging Lethbridge - 4310","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (see the account button at the top right). The "},{"type":"text","text":"Location","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" control reading "},{"type":"text","text":"\"All locations\"","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is on screen at the far right of the toolbar. The table headers correctly carry "},{"type":"text","text":"no","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Location column."}]},{"type":"rule"},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"7 · Technical details for developers"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Evidence file:","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"build/report-suite/viu-2026-08-03/evidence/singleloc-matrix.json","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"text","text":"buildMarker: \"v3.4.1-0ed4433\"","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"text","text":"capturedAt: \"2026-08-03T18:59:19.110Z\"","marks":[{"type":"code"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Subject, as recorded in that file:","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]},{"type":"